      "content": "Yes, for WCAG 2.1 compliance, ensure all text meets a contrast ratio of at least 4.5:1 on light gray backgrounds (AA level). You must also include `aria-label` or `alt` text for all non-representative icon buttons and dynamically loaded content. Finally, always test your app with a visual screen reader like NVDA or VoiceOver to verify that interactive elements are properly announced by the browser.",
