    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it. the table header thing is a good catch. i've also noticed some small, hard-to-spot glitches during testing—like tiny layout shifts or elements that look fine but act weirdly under specific conditions. how can we best identify those kinds of sneaky, underlying issues before we push to production?",
