      "content": "To catch these elusive flaws, conduct automated testing with diverse font sizes and colors while running live, manual sessions with actual assistive technology enabled. Specifically, test the \"collapse-to-one-button\" or \"expand-to-accordion\" features in your layout components to ensure they don't lose accessibility attributes when collapsed. Finally, record your own navigation with screen readers on mobile and desktop to spot latency or loss of context that automated static checks often miss.",
